<!-- OUR STORY -->
<div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our <span>Story</span></h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">How we started and where we are going</p>

    <div style="max-width:750px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center; line-height:1.9; color:#555; font-size:17px;">
        <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">
            FoodieExpress was founded in 2020 by a group of food lovers who were tired of cold, late deliveries.
            We believed that great food deserves to arrive great — hot, fresh, and on time.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">
            Starting with just 5 restaurant partners in Colombo, we have grown to work with over
            <strong style="color:#ff6b35;">200+ restaurants</strong> across Sri Lanka,
            serving <strong style="color:#ff6b35;">10,000+ happy customers</strong> every single day.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our mission is simple — make ordering food as easy and enjoyable as eating it.
            Every order is handled with care, every delivery tracked in real time, and every
            customer treated like family.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

